// spin.gani: the spin attack, one turn clockwise
// Original Seihai default animation; layout and numbers follow documentation/asset-reference.md.
// A step is four direction rows (up, left, down, right) of 'sprite x y' placements.
SETBACKTO idle
DEFAULTHEAD head0.png
DEFAULTBODY body.png

SPRITE 0 SPRITES 0 0 24 12 shadow
SPRITE 304 SWORD 0 32 32 32 sword arc up
SPRITE 305 SWORD 32 32 32 32 sword arc left
SPRITE 306 SWORD 64 32 32 32 sword arc down
SPRITE 307 SWORD 96 32 32 32 sword arc right
SPRITE 40 ATTR1 0 0 48 48 hat up
SPRITE 41 ATTR1 48 0 48 48 hat left
SPRITE 42 ATTR1 96 0 48 48 hat down
SPRITE 43 ATTR1 144 0 48 48 hat right
SPRITE 100 HEAD 0 0 32 32 head up
SPRITE 101 HEAD 0 32 32 32 head left
SPRITE 102 HEAD 0 64 32 32 head down
SPRITE 103 HEAD 0 96 32 32 head right
SPRITE 240 BODY 0 320 32 32 body pose 10 up
SPRITE 241 BODY 32 320 32 32 body pose 10 left
SPRITE 242 BODY 64 320 32 32 body pose 10 down
SPRITE 243 BODY 96 320 32 32 body pose 10 right

